### Payment Provider A — Validate Payment (example)
POST https://api.payment-provider-a.example/v1/validate-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "aaaaaaa0-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "customerId": "cust-12345",
  "paymentInstrument": {
    "type": "card",
    "card": {
      "brand": "visa",
      "last4": "4242",
      "expiryMonth": 12,
      "expiryYear": 2028,
      "token": "tok_sample_123"
    }
  }
}

### Payment Provider A — Validation response (example)
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "validationId": "val-0001",
  "status": "valid",
  "reason": null,
  "timestamp": "2026-06-09T12:05:00Z"
}

### Payment Provider A — Decline example
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "validationId": "val-0002",
  "status": "invalid",
  "reason": "card_expired",
  "timestamp": "2026-06-09T12:05:00Z"
}
